  "description": "This meme is classified as hateful because it normalizes and minimizes the use of a deeply offensive racial slur ('nigger'), which is a term historically and currently used to demean and dehumanize Black people. The juxtaposition of the dog's innocent appearance with the hateful text creates a false equivalence, suggesting that the offense is trivial, which is a form of indirect attack on Black people and their dignity.",
